<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Mar palm oil exports 620,004t -Caleb.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Mar palm oil exports 620,004t -Caleb.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Caleb Brett put Malaysia's March bulk palm oil exports at 620,004 tonnes against its estimate of 455,317 for February, traders said.</p>
<p>The figures include laurics and oleochemicals but exclude shipments to Singapore and exports in drum, said the traders who obtained the data by facsimile.</p>
<p>The official Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority put February exports at 376,885 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
